    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Neajeeda siimajeek",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwalamda ak gwayeesha Musa, “Ascheeng'ni apkaana heeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ang'iing'i ea Haruni, Nadabu ea Habihu, ea gwearu laadam ea damanamughuush bea Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygwaneekiisa Musa NG'UTAMIIDA, nea gabwageaw nea buuneesuurja ea mayghapka gwaneekiit, nea eara buuneeda ea mayghwascheang'da sea niny.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwahita Musa ak gwarukusa buuneeda ng'asheega sean bea NG'UTAMIIDA ea deaweedajeagaaschi sean, hean ghwasha buuneeda aba ghuudagi nea gwayi, “Ng'asheega sean rugu NG'UTAMIIDA gajeesina.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'oar Musa ng'asheega sean bea NG'UTAMIIDA. Ak ghang'eat nea gudea sakteayda duw gil, ak ghwadeas heeda wagiida aba geeshta giijeeda, ak ghamiinda daranaji damaniyeenya, gwadeena mooneeda dooshinga fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goojeakta gheareemanga fuga Israeli, jea ghoadayda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda sighwarda, ea heewga hoyyoo sisabwa geadi bea NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanu Musa foojeanda mwaatkwa ak ghwayiin jeesinga dabita, iidu foojeanda mwaatkwa ghwayiin heeda wagiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gageanu gitaaboodida sing'oorsa neajeedean ak ghoasoamwa aba ghuuta haw nea ghoaleaydiit buuneeda, ng'ata gwayi buuneeda, “Ng'asheega sean rugu NG'UTAMIIDA gajeesina, nea geesisi mureeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gageanu Musa foojeanda ak gwasaksa buuneeda nea gwayeesha, “Ng'ula, suh foojeanda neajeeda sin NG'UTAMIIDA gil sea agooga aba jeeda ng'asheega seaniin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwascheang'da Musa ea Haruni, Nadabu, ea Habihu, ea gweargwa Israeli was laadam ea damanamughuush, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak geadaah ASEETA Israeli, nea geeshangaaschi nea gwanda giduurji lagheaneeda gaseaduw oar humng'eeda aba alooheadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak niny ea miighwayiin geatindaanyi uhuuda gweargwa fuga Israeli, ak geadaah ASEETA ak geeyeagiischi nea geeleeshi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Musa aba uhuuda giijeeda Sinayi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha Musa, “Diyeana beeni heedeanyu aba uhuuda giijeeda, ak giibiidi hiji, ak gaydagoonyi lagheaneeda sing'oorsa deaweeda ea diigheanda, aang'oarji jea ghoanaaleagwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eat Musa sea Yoshuwa was siidaanyi weat aba gadiyeeda ak gwadiyeada Musa gawa uhuuda giijeeda ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha Musa gweargwa, “Oomukghuneasa aba hiji ea eebiikna, ng'ula goondeawi Haruni ea Huri iyoondeawi ng'ashaan gooweesi saawa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwadiyeada Musa gawa uhuuda giijeeda, ak gwadukuta giijeeda shamooghooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwadukuta giijeeda Sinayi giigheambiita NG'UTAMIIDA, nea gwadukuta shamooghooda giijeeda eawooji lah, ak eaweedeaba ispwa gaguursa NG'UTAMIIDA Musa aba bugusta shamooghooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea deakta giigheambiita NG'UTAMIIDA gawuurji beasta yeat aba uhuuda giijeeda ak ea daachi aba madeeda fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak iidu gawa Musa jeeda shamooghoodida, ak gwadiyeada gawa uhuuda giijeeda. Musa goobiida uhuuda giijeeda eawooji haradam eawa ea askweari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
